# macOS
.DS_Store

# Reference doc, not part of the site
Jayco website.pdf

# Stray skill folders (not part of the website)
claude:skills:frontend-design:/
claude:skills:video-to-website:/
assets/models/*.psd

# Print-res model photography (8K+ stills, 70 MB+ video) stays local.
# Only the web derivatives under each model's web/ folder are committed —
# they sit one level deeper, so these patterns leave them alone.
assets/model details/*/*.jpg
assets/model details/*/*.png
assets/model details/*/*.mp4
assets/model details/*/*.mov

# The patterns above only reach ONE level down, so source material filed in a
# deeper folder walks straight past them — this one is 72 files and 32 MB that
# nothing on the site references. The two folders under "model details" that
# ARE loaded are each model's web/ and builder/ (build-data.js reads its
# floorplan drawings and decor swatches from there).
assets/model details/Travel Trailers/

# Same rule, same reason, for the model-type photography: 13 originals up to
# 65 MB each, of which the site loads none. web/ is one level deeper.
assets/model types/*/*.jpg
assets/model types/*/*.png
assets/model types/*/*.mp4
assets/model types/*/*.mov

# …except this one, which is already web-ready at 11 MB and is the video in the
# type page's "which one is yours" band. It sits beside the originals rather
# than under web/, so the rule above swallowed it and the band deployed with a
# 404 where the video should be. Named explicitly rather than moved, because
# type-data.js builds its path from a prefix const and moving the file would
# mean the deploy and the local copy disagree until that is edited too.
!assets/model types/fifth wheel/jayco-fifth-wheel-options.mp4

# The quiz library: 155 originals, four of them 46–70 MB. These sit flat in the
# folder rather than in per-model subfolders, so the pattern is one level up —
# and assets/quiz/web/, the eleven exports the quiz actually loads, is untouched.
assets/quiz/*.jpg
assets/quiz/*.jpeg
assets/quiz/*.png

# The brochures hero: one 6.4 MB, 2400x1598 plate, of which the page loads a
# cropped pair of webps at 1200 and 1800. Same rule as every block above — the
# original stays local, assets/brochures/web/ is one level deeper and untouched.
assets/brochures/*.jpg

# The delivered master of the news section's hookups video: 17 MB at 36 Mbps,
# where the two cards beside it run 8.5–10.8. The news videos play on hover, so
# that whole file would have to arrive between the pointer landing and the first
# frame moving. -v2-web.mp4 beside it is the 1280x720 / 5 Mbps derivative the
# page actually loads; this stays local so the master is never re-encoded from
# a compressed copy.
assets/jayco-news-hookups-v2.mp4

# Local Netlify folder
.netlify

# Tooling, not the site: a vendored copy of a skill plus machine-local settings.
.claude/

# The owner-gallery originals: 28 plates from 3.7 to 70 MB, ~900 MB for the set,
# of which the page loads a 900w/1500w webp pair each (5.2 MB total). Same rule
# as every block above — the originals stay local, assets/testimonials/web/ is a
# level deeper and untouched.
assets/testimonials/*.jpg
